---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<LegalPage title="Refund Policy" description="Refund and cancellation terms for iswar.me subscriptions and services.">
	<p>This Refund Policy applies to subscriptions for software provided by One MB Co through iswar.me. Paddle is the Merchant of Record for transactions processed through Paddle.</p>

	<h2>1. Cancellation</h2>
	<p>You may cancel your subscription at any time through <a href="https://paddle.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">paddle.net</a> or by emailing <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a>. Cancellation stops future renewals. You will normally retain access through the end of the current paid billing period.</p>

	<h2>2. Refund window</h2>
	<p>If you are not satisfied with a subscription, you may request a refund for any payment, including a renewal payment, within 14 days of the date that payment was made. You can request a refund directly through <a href="https://paddle.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">paddle.net</a>, or contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a> with the account email and payment details so we can help locate the transaction.</p>

	<h2>3. Renewals and billing errors</h2>
	<p>We will also review requests for duplicate charges, incorrect charges, or service access problems and issue an appropriate refund when the charge was made in error.</p>

	<h2>4. How refunds are paid</h2>
	<p>Approved refunds are sent through Paddle to the original payment method. Processing times depend on your bank or card provider. A refund does not automatically cancel a subscription, so please request cancellation as well if you do not want future renewals.</p>

	<h2>5. Contact</h2>
	<p>For refund or cancellation help, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a>. We aim to respond within three business days. One MB Co's registered address is 3107/321/C/3, Margram Road, Kalisara Para, near Margram More, Rampurhat, Birbhum, West Bengal 731224, India. Nothing in this policy limits any statutory consumer rights that cannot be excluded or restricted by law.</p>
</LegalPage>
